const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"A regular hexagon drawn as a cube, its three faces round the middle. The hexagon's corners are marked by stepping the compass round the outer circle from the top; its rim is the band between two hexagons 5 apart, and the three edges that part the faces run from the middle to every second corner. Each face holds a square spiral, a band 5 wide whose runs lie along the face's two edges, that starts on one edge and turns in three turns to a short hook. The spiral of the top face is built in full and the other two where they stand, a third and two thirds of a turn round.","ja":"正六角形を、三つの面が中心に集まる立方体の形に描きます。六角形の角は、外円の上でコンパスを12時から時計回りに進めて印をつけます。縁は、5ずつ離した二つの六角形の間の帯で、面を分ける三本の線は、中心から一つおきの角へ引きます。どの面にも、幅5の四角い渦を入れます。渦の帯は面の二つの辺に沿って走り、一つの辺から始まって三回曲がり、短いかぎ形で終わります。上の面の渦を先に作図し、あとの二つは3分の1回転と3分の2回転まわった位置に、その場で作図します。"};

